opes that within five years, recovery science will be as central to marathon training as pacing strategy already is[14]. [15]Until then, she says, coaches and runners alike will have to balance patience with the incomplete evidence currently available[15].',
    questionText: '[underlined: She hopes that within five years, recovery science will be as central to marathon training as pacing strategy already is]',
    options: [
