nd coastal residents can anticipate glowing nights in advance[14]. [15]If the tool succeeds, it would mark one of the first times traditional local knowledge and satellite data have been combined this directly in marine science[15].',
    questionText: '[underlined: The light itself comes from a chemical reaction inside the organism\'s cells, similar to the reaction that makes fireflies glow]',
    options: [
      'The light itself comes from a chemical reaction inside the organisms cells, similar to the reaction that makes fireflies glow',
