      'In calm conditions she uses the engine, while in stormy conditions she relies on the current alone to move the barge',
      'In calm conditions she checks the manifest herself, while in stormy conditions she asks the narrator to check it instead',
      'In calm conditions she avoids the crossing entirely, while in stormy conditions she insists on crossing regardless of the weather',
      'In calm conditions she lets the narrator steer, while in stormy conditions she takes the wheel herself and demonstrates how to read and work with the current',
